stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Candidate: Read call outcomes
    Candidate --> Exact: Same deal and owner, open, same normalized text
    Candidate --> Related: Different text or owner, open task on deal
    Candidate --> NoMatch: No eligible open task on deal
    Exact --> Recheck: Accept task
    Related --> Recheck: Accept task
    NoMatch --> Recheck: Accept task
    Recheck --> Reused: Exact task remains eligible
    Recheck --> Created: No eligible exact task
    Reused --> Reused: Replay accepted candidate
    Exact --> Recheck: Task changed after preview
    note right of Exact
      Collapse ECMAScript whitespace, trim edges, lowercase.
      Preserve recipients and documents in the comparison key.
      Keep current date unless candidate states an explicit date.
    end note
    %% never merge different owners, deals, recipients, documents or closed tasks
    %% never replace an existing date with a defaulted date
